{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/B2 note.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "B2 note": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "It still breaks sometimes! \n\nIt started to move on its own yesterday and I have no idea why. I feel like it's cursed or something. \n\nMaybe I'll use something else than mannequins! Also that hallway isn't even long enough. B2 was at least three times longer. \n\nMaybe change door code to 4027?\n": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/B3 storage.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "B3 storage": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "I'm hearing breathing in the B3 storage! \n\nThat place must be also cursed! I'm going to make sure that thing is going to stay there so I'm going to brick the door and also take that handwheel from the flood door. Whatever it is even. I still remember what happened in that tunnel near Hammer Valley. I don't want to that same thing happen here in Obenseuer tunnels.\n\n-Robin": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/Bergmann tunnel floodgates.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Bergmann tunnel floodgates": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Notice!\n\nIt seems that Robin fellow changed the flood door settings, because the flood sensors didn't work anymore. So now you have to close the floodgates that are connected to this tunnel and also open main 02. Remember also check those fuses at control room!\n\n-Mike, new Bergmann tunnel worker": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/Bergmann tunnel fuses.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Control room fuses": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Slot 1 (Left): Floodgates control A1\nSlot 2: Floodgates control A2\nSlot 3: Microwave\nSlot 4: B3": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/Bergmann tunnels condition.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Bergmann tunnels condition": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "They have renovated bergmann tunnels everywhere except here in Obenseuer and things are getting worse every day. I'm probably not going to be able to come here soon, because of that fungal disease. \n\nAnyway, I still have a lot of things to get fixed here, because that previous Bergmann tunnel worker Robin broke everything! Like that flood door at the bottom! You have to close floodgates that leads to that tunnel and open main 02 to get that flood door open.\n\n-Mike": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement B2/Flood door sign.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Flood door sign": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "NOTICE\n\nLIGHTS\n\nIf the light is red, the area behind the door may be flooded, or the door may be having technical difficulties. The flood door cannot be opened when the light is red.\n\nIf the light is green, the area behind the door is not flooded and is safe for entry. The flood door can ONLY be opened when the light is green.\n\nWARNING\n\nDO NOT BE UNDER THE FLOOD DOOR WHILE IT IS CLOSING. IT MAY CAUSE SERIOUS INJURY OR DEATH.\n\nTWSC\n": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tests/Long test placeholder note with long placeholder text.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Long test placeholder note with long placeholder text": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets7.assets"]}, "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Quis ipsum suspendisse ultrices gravida. Risus commodo viverra maecenas accumsan lacus vel facilisis. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusm